                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-09-21"><hi rendition="#italic">September 21,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. McCormick reports that the time limit of appeal in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Calchas</hi> case for the master and shippers has been
                    extended to October 22 and December 12, respectively.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
